#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To get information about a qubit's state, you can _measure_ it onto a [classical bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). In Qiskit, measurements are performed in the computational basis, that is, the single-qubit Pauli-$Z$ basis. Therefore, a measurement yields 0 or 1, depending on the overlap with the Pauli-$Z$ eigenstates $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Aby uzyskać informacje o stanie Qubitu, możesz go _zmierzyć_ na [klasyczny bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). W Qiskit pomiary wykonywane są w bazie obliczeniowej, czyli jednoQubitowej bazie Pauliego-$Z$. W związku z tym pomiar daje wynik 0 lub 1, zależnie od nakładania się ze stanami własnymi Pauliego-$Z$, $|0\\rangle$ i $|1\\rangle$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a measurement to a circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"
msgstr "Zastosowanie pomiaru do Circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to apply measurements to a circuit:\n"
msgstr "Istnieje kilka sposobów na zastosowanie pomiarów do Circuit:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"
msgstr "Metoda `QuantumCircuit.measure` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the "
"[`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure)"
" method to measure a "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class).\n"
msgstr ""
"Użyj metody "
"[`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure),"
" aby zmierzyć "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-"
"class).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Examples:\n"
msgstr "Przykłady:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`Measure` class {#measure-class}"
msgstr "Klasa `Measure` {#measure-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit "
"[Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure)"
" class measures the specified qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Klasa Qiskit "
"[Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure)"
" mierzy wskazane Qubity.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"
msgstr ""
"Metoda `QuantumCircuit.measure_all` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To measure all qubits into the corresponding classical bits, use the "
"[`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all)"
" method. By default, this method adds new classical bits in a "
"`ClassicalRegister` to store these measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aby zmierzyć wszystkie Qubity na odpowiadające im klasyczne bity, użyj "
"metody "
"[`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all)."
" Domyślnie ta metoda dodaje nowe klasyczne bity w `ClassicalRegister`, które"
" przechowują te pomiary.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-"
"method}"
msgstr ""
"Metoda `QuantumCircuit.measure_active` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-"
"method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To measure all qubits that are not idle, use the "
"[`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active)"
" method. This method creates a new `ClassicalRegister` with a size equal to "
"the number of non-idle qubits being measured.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aby zmierzyć wszystkie Qubity, które nie są bezczynne, użyj metody "
"[`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active)."
" Ta metoda tworzy nowy `ClassicalRegister` o rozmiarze równym liczbie "
"mierzonych niebezczynnych Qubitów.\n"

